  "schema:name": "Integrated Shared Care Plan (SCP)",
  "schema:description": "Integrated Shared Care Plan (SCP):\r\nA dynamic, longitudinal care plan accessible and updatable by all authorized providers.\r\nIncludes problems, goals, interventions, responsibilities, progress, and patient preferences.\r\nPatient-facing view with personalized instructions and self-management support.\r\nPopulation analytics product → aggregated data for care coordination KPIs (e.g., readmission reduction, continuity index).",
